[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15361.03, "timestamp": "04:16:01", "text": "再次记住，如果它公开的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15365.189, "timestamp": "04:16:05", "text": "整个社区都会尽力而为。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15366.75, "timestamp": "04:16:06", "text": "带你"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15369.004, "timestamp": "04:16:09", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "listening"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15369.99, "timestamp": "04:16:09", "text": "向下。无论你是公司员工，无论"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15373.71, "timestamp": "04:16:13", "text": "你是个有才华的人，或者你是个……"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15377.092, "timestamp": "04:16:17", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "expand on it a lil"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15377.71, "timestamp": "04:16:17", "text": "独立音乐界，社区站稳了脚跟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15380.55, "timestamp": "04:16:20", "text": "需要的时候在一起"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15388.07, "timestamp": "04:16:28", "text": "例如，当那个机构黑化时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15392.55, "timestamp": "04:16:32", "text": "机构……呃……我忘了是哪个机构了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15395.91, "timestamp": "04:16:35", "text": "它是什么？或者它在哪里？它来自哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15399.11, "timestamp": "04:16:39", "text": "该机构记录了它所创造的人才"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15401.99, "timestamp": "04:16:41", "text": "IRL 信息一切公开号码"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15403.87, "timestamp": "04:16:43", "text": "电话号码"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15407.75, "timestamp": "04:16:47", "text": "所有东西都像这样抵制那个地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15410.469, "timestamp": "04:16:50", "text": "很多人都反对，而且所有人都反对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15413.189, "timestamp": "04:16:53", "text": "那些不了解才能的人，也同样不具备这种才能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15415.59, "timestamp": "04:16:55", "text": "他们是不知道什么的先祖"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15418.229, "timestamp": "04:16:58", "text": "他们得知此事后，就发生了这件事。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15418.261, "timestamp": "04:16:58", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "that's just stupid to door why dox em"}]